# Optional installation defaults only. Anyone can add an account or direct league in the UI.
# Use a stable provider ID; legacy SLEEPER_USERNAME remains supported.
# SLEEPER_USER_ID=
# SLEEPER_LEAGUE_IDS=comma,separated,public,league,ids
# NFL_SEASON=                 # normally resolved from Sleeper's NFL state
# ARCHIVE_REPOSITORY=owner/repository

# Local private ESPN mode (ADR 0005). Local machine only; ignored on Vercel. Run ONLY with: pnpm dev:private
# (it listens on 127.0.0.1 and sets a per-launch loopback token; never set FANTASY_LOOPBACK_TOKEN yourself).
# Both files must live OUTSIDE this repository; never commit league IDs, bundles or scoring configs.
# FANTASY_PRIVATE_MODE=local
# ESPN_PRIVATE_CONFIG=/absolute/path/outside/repo/espn-private.json
